extends /specs/products/corp/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    section.source_section
        h2 Buttons variations

        h3 Default with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn Button

        h3 Secondary with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn--secondary` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--secondary Button

        h3 Disabled button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `disabled` attribute to make the button disabled.
        .source_example
            button.btn(disabled="disabled") Button

        h3 Inverse button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn--inverse` to the button item.
        .source_example.dark-bg
            button.btn.btn--inverse Button

        h3 Simple button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn--simple-primary`, `btn btn--simple-secondary` to the button item to be fluid width.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--simple-primary Button
            button.btn.btn--simple-secondary Button

        h3 Buttons with icon
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn` to the button item.

        .source_example
            button.btn
                i.icon-calendar
                | Button

        .source_example
            button.btn
                | Button
                i.icon-caret.right

        .source_example
            button.btn
                i.icon-clock
                | Button
                i.icon-caret.right

        h3 Dropdown Buttons with icon
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn--dropdown` to the button item.

        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--dropdown
                i.icon-calendar
                | Button
                i.icon-caret.right


    section.source_section
        h2 Text links

        h3 Links
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `text-link text-link--large`, `text-link`, `text-link text-link--small` class to the `a` item.
        .source_example
            .col-md-4
                p
                    a(href="#").text-link Text link
            .col-md-4
                p
                    a(href="#").text-link.text-link--secondary Text link
            .col-md-4.dark-bg
                p
                    a(href="#").text-link.text-link--inverse Text link
    | #{''}
    section.source_section
        h2 Toggle menu button

        h3 On light background
        markdown
            p `nav-button`
        .source_example
            .nav-button
                span
                span
                span
